# Automatic text summarization within big data frameworks

**Authors:** Andrew L. Mackey, Israel Alatorre Cuevas

## Abstract
Data increasing at unabated rates will prove to be challenging for individuals trying to effectively leverage it. This paper describes an approach to automatically summarize text documents by utilizing statistical and information retrieval methodologies within big data frameworks that support the distributed parallel processing of data. A pedagogical approach to the incorporation of automatic summarization and big data topics within data mining, machine learning, or natural language processing courses is detailed.

